    "title": "AKU lamplighting ceremony",
    "subtitle": null,
    "summary": "To commemorate the 184th birthday of Florence Nightingale, Aga Khan University School of Nursing held its 23rd Lamplighting Ceremony at which 118 nurses from BScN and RN Diploma programmes took their pledge to honour the international code of nursing",
